		r16 aes, ces fes r16 ees r16 ees16 | r16 aes, ces fes r16 ees8 r16 | aes,,16 aes ces aes' aes, aes' ces aes' | aes,,16 aes' ces aes' \ottava #1 aes, aes' c aes' \ottava #0 |
		aes,8 aes aes aes16 aes~ | aes16 ees f c ees f8 aes,16~ | aes16 bes ces aes bes c!8 aes16 | c16 aes bes8 aes8. aes16~ |
